            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Despairing Presence"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, emotion, enchantment, fear, incapacitation, mental, primal)\n\n60 feet. A creature that enters the emanation or starts its turn within it tumbles down a deep well of dread and must attempt a DC 33 Will save.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
